<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's National Bank cuts fixed home lending rates.</title>
<headline>NZ's National Bank cuts fixed home lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday its one, two and three year home loan fixed interest rates were all now 10.50 percent.</p>
<p>Previously they were 10.90 percent, 10.75 percent and 10.50 percent per annum respectively.</p>
<p>The floating rate remains unchanged at 11.50 percent.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
